          },
          "name": "local slot (on-host LLM providers) - tried before the extras (msrouter config, not facts.md)",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "7jv44SNFJ3zvaVuVZo5q",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "55pSxVprqprzccIqfZaj"
          },
          "name": "pause switch - msrouter.yaml replicas 0 + finder FINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLNote",
          "_id": "OfdUOgbaMyKMg5oVaHD7",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "55pSxVprqprzccIqfZaj"
          },
          "text": "GCP is the Google Gemini slot in msrouter\nBase URL: generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai\nDefault model: gemini-2.5-flash-lite, free tier via GEMINI_API_KEY.\nOrder: unorouter, groq, sambanova, mistral, gemini, cline, cloudflare.\nCloudflare is last in the walk; the local on-host slot comes first.\nThe extras order is the facts.md EXTRA_PROVIDER_ORDER; the primary\nand local slots come from msrouter config, not facts.md.\nPause switch (moves together): msrouter replicas 0 and finder\nFINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false -> CvScorer fallback score 70; the\nscore >= 60 CV filter stops rejecting and APPLY_MODE stays shadow."
        },
